            <div class="post__content grid" data-headline="A Stunningly Minimal Gallery in Beijing" data-url="https://www.azuremagazine.com/article/zen-minimal-interior-beijing-rongbaozhai-western-art-gallery/">
                                            <div class="hero__metadata-container hero__metadata-container--article  hero__metadata-container--no-image">
        <!-- For posts with hero images, spit out a mobile version so metadata is kept together -->
                            <div class="hero__title title">
                <div class="block-title">
                    <h1>A Stunningly Minimal Gallery in Beijing</h2>
                </div>
            </div>
                            <div class="hero__deck">
                    <h2>Local firm Arch Studio has converted a traditional Chinese house into the Rongbaozhai Western Art Gallery, by deploying screens at every turn to organize space while maintaining a sense of zen-like simplicity.</h2>
                </div>
                            <div class="hero__metadata-inner hero__metadata-inner--article">
            <dl class="hero__meta meta">
